Project Documentation Phase

ComicCraft-AI – Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

The Project Documentation Phase is the final stage of the project, where all information related to the development of ComicCraft-AI is organized and documented. The documentation explains the project's objectives, requirements, design, development, testing, and final results.

1. Project Introduction

ComicCraft-AI is an AI-powered comic story creation application that uses Gemini models to generate creative comic stories from user-provided ideas. The system can generate characters, scenes, dialogues, captions, and comic panels.

2. Project Objectives

The documentation describes the main objectives of the project:

To develop an AI-based comic story creator.

To integrate Gemini models for story generation.

To generate characters, scenes, and dialogues automatically.

To provide a simple and user-friendly interface.

To allow users to edit and regenerate comic content.

To save and export generated comic stories.


