6. Gemini Integration Documentation

The documentation explains how Gemini models are used in the application.

A user's prompt is sent to the Gemini model through the application backend. Gemini processes the prompt and returns structured comic content.

Example:

> "Create a fantasy comic story about a student who discovers a magical book."



The system can generate:

Title

Story

Characters

Scenes

Dialogues

Captions

Panel descriptions


