9. Results and Output

The final documentation presents the results of the project. The completed system should be able to transform a simple user idea into a structured comic story with characters, scenes, dialogues, captions, and panels.

10. Conclusion

The documentation concludes that ComicCraft-AI – Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models successfully demonstrates the use of generative AI for automated comic-story creation. It provides users with an easy way to convert their creative ideas into organized comic stories while reducing the time and effort required for manual story development.

